          "t": "No wonder.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01215",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "你脸色不好，走路也晃晃悠悠的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "You look pale, and you are staggering when you walk.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01215",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "阿繁伸手去摸了摸千重子的额头，“倒没发烧，可是显得很悲伤的样子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Oshige reached out and felt Chieko's forehead. You do not have a fever, but you look very sad.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "the-old-capital-p01215",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "今晚家里又有客人，你就跟妈一块儿睡吧。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "There will be guests at the house again tonight, so sleep with Mother.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
